    <string name="how_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="how_1_title">1. Prepare the phone.</string>
    <string name="how_1_body">Leave a phone in the car with a SIM card that has at least one unit of credit, so it can make calls. No internet needed.</string>
    <string name="how_2_title">2. Activate the protection.</string>
    <string name="how_2_body">Enter your personal number (or your second mobile), choose the sensitivity, then tap “Activate protection”.</string>
    <string name="how_3_title">3. Receive the alert.</string>
    <string name="how_3_body">If the car moves, the phone calls you. Don’t answer: reject the call and go check your car.</string>
